A viable native family has emerged from Section 3 rather than from naïve triangle planting: the solver receives a fat-head crown and must supply its witness packing. I’m treating it as Track B because Lemma 2 explicitly reduces witness production to bipartite matching. The compact certificate will encode a projective transformation whose expansion is the packing; the general matching algorithm remains disclosed and benchmarked.
