The bare run is now at `hard` (`p=251`). Easy and medium were each solved 3/3, which confirms the failure mode is the compact projective route—not parser leakage or an accidental planted outlier. Hard is the final named preset before fixed-answer escalation.
diff --git a/gen_2308_16515.py b/gen_2308_16515.py
