Rejected correctly; no generator is shipped.

- G and V passed for the retained fat-head-crown construction.
- Track B failed: Lemma 2’s matching algorithm used 3,213 scans, while the compact route needed at most 228 operations. The oracle solved every compliant rung, yielding `too_easy`.
- The proposed Track-A triangle planting also failed: Algorithm X solved 40/40 prototypes in 63–5,307 nodes.

Evidence:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2308.16515/REJECTED.md)
- [retained generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2308.16515/rejected_gen_2308_16515.py)
- [oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2308.16515/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [.meta.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2308.16515/.meta.json)

The decision is based on the paper’s full definitions and Lemmas 2–3, not its abstract: [arXiv full text](https://arxiv.org/html/2308.16515v1).
